      "writtenOn": "2023-02-16T21:58:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the answer!\n\nIn this case, I think one LTV input makes sense. \n\nIt looks like you are using, the `Vendor_Specific` metadata definition Page 7 of the current Generic Audio assigned number document. \n\nCould you update the comment of this API to reference the above document so that there is no ambiguity on which `Vendor_Specific` metadata we are talking about?",
